('d-renumbers-scoped-by-catalog-year-s663','decision','A prior-year record is scored against its own year''s course numbers','course_renumbers_by_year[<catalog year>] in kb/program_requirements_reconcile.json maps a code that year printed to the state''s code; prefix_aliases and course_renumbers take the record''s catalog_year, so only that year''s records use it. Pairs come from the catalog''s own title and units (RCC 2025-2026: MAT 1C/2/3/5 to MATH, ECO 7H/8H to ECON C2002H/C2001H); MAT-1AH and CIS-5 left out.',array['program-requirements-harvest','prior-catalog','renumbers'],'proposed','#3385; page read 43815976514; run 43816942139','SkyLark (S663)',date '2026-11-16'),
('f-rcc-2025-catalog-prints-two-2-0-programs-s663','fact','Riverside City''s 2025-2026 catalog already prints Communication Studies and Business Administration 2.0','Catalog 71''s entries 3731 and 3713 are titled 2.0, so the originals 30578 and 33829 are older than 2025-2026 (2024-2025 is archive 7). Mathematics 32692 (filed, passes, reread 43822316519 replaced its row) and Physics 32745 are the plain programs in catalog 71.',array['program-requirements-harvest','prior-catalog','riverside-city'],'proposed','page read 43815976514 (kb/college_reads/rcc_prior_year_course_codes.json)','SkyLark (S663)',date '2026-11-16'),
('p-prior-read-names-more-than-filed-s663','pitfall','A prior-year record can fail where the record it replaces passes by naming more','Physics 32745''s 2025-2026 record reads the 60-unit degree total and Cal-GETC with no Cal-GETC units, so arithmetic is incomplete; the filed 2026-2027 record named neither and passes. Never file a failing record over a passing one: keep_no_read drops failing records on the next capture. A cited Cal-GETC units step comes first.',array['program-requirements-harvest','prior-catalog'],'proposed','run 43816942139; #3385','SkyLark (S663)',date '2026-11-16')
on conflict (slug) do nothing;
